{
  "name": "Monthly P&L support for Arthur Andersen gas testing",
  "today": "Each month Arthur Andersen (Sharon Smith, Carrie Richardson, Mark Austin) emails the four gas desk controllers (William Kelly, Kam Keiser, Darron Giron, David Baumbach) a list of books. Each controller forwards it to his book admins, who pull the last-day P&L top page and, where the P&L is mostly curve shift, the top pages and curve-shift reports for the five largest days. The admins hand them back to the controller, who passes them to AA, sometimes as paper copies AA has to come and collect. The work stalls when a controller is travelling or has changed jobs, when AA has to ask who is responsible for a desk, and when items are still missing weeks later, which brings second requests.",
  "change": "Save each gas book's month-end P&L top page, its five largest-day top pages and the curve-shift reports for those days to a dated folder AA can read, so nobody has to pull them on request.",
  "explanation": "At month-end close, a scheduled job (or one book admin running a short checklist) saves, for every gas book, the P&L top page for the last day of the month, the top pages for the five days with the largest P&L, and the curve-shift reports for those days. They go into a read-only folder named by month and book. AA takes the books it chose from the folder instead of emailing the controllers. Controllers check once that the folder is complete and still handle AA's follow-up questions about what drove the P&L, which do not change. The forwarding chain, the hand-pulling of reports on request, the second requests and the 'who is responsible' questions go away. One point to settle first: AA staff lose Enron Lotus Notes access from 28 February 2001, so the folder must be one AA can reach.",
  "occurrences": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/516.eml",
      "quote": "In order for us to complete our monthly gas testing, please provide the"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/515.eml",
      "quote": "Please provide us with the P&L top sheet as of October 31 for the following"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/583.eml",
      "quote": "Please provide the top sheets relating to the following desk:  West Firm,"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/420.eml",
      "quote": "Pull this together and then call Sharon so they can come get the copies."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/327.eml",
      "quote": "We are requesting that you supply the P & L top pages for the"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/201.eml",
      "quote": "Please make sure this guy gets what he needs."
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/516.eml",
      "quote": "Please get this info to me and I will pass it on to AA.",
      "note": "The controller forwards AA's list to four book admins and relays the results back: the hand-off chain the folder removes."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/583.eml",
      "quote": "Darron has taken my position as west controller.  Please send him all future",
      "note": "A second request for August went to the old controller and had to be rerouted. He then asked the new one to 'forward this to the appropriate book admin'."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/420.eml",
      "quote": "we have not received the P&L top pages",
      "note": "In December AA was still missing third-quarter top pages and curve-shift reports for three West regions."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/326.eml",
      "quote": "Is there someone else that can direct us to?  I would like to get this",
      "note": "The January request stalled while the controller was away in Chicago, and AA asked for someone else to go to."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/299.eml",
      "quote": "please direct me to the individual responsible",
      "note": "AA does not know which admin handles each desk, so it has to ask the controller first."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/322.eml",
