      "note": "The request is passed on again among the admins, depending on who ran each book that month."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/201.eml",
      "quote": "As of February 28th, Arthur Andersen employees will no longer have",
      "note": "AA is losing Enron Lotus Notes access, so the shared folder must be on a system AA can still reach."
    }
  ],
  "ongoing": true,
  "stated_rate": {
