  "name": "Weekly purchase-requisition processing by Mary Poorman",
  "change": "Move requisitions to SAP purchasing self-service with automatic approval routing and a named backup, so the coordinator handles only exceptions.",
  "reason": "The only evidence is one offhand remark in a message of doubtful origin (482.eml) that says nothing about the steps, volume or tools of the requisition work, so neither the SAP self-service fix nor the 10-hours-a-week saving can be shown from the mail.",
  "research": "Find mail that shows the requisition work happening: requisitions sent to or by Poorman, approval chases, purchasing or SAP requisition system mail, counts per week, and where the time goes. Confirm the message's origin against normal mail as well."
}

{
  "name": "Next-day long/short position notices to the Real Time shift",
